abstract: "Code and derived outputs for an analytical, simulation and observed-price study of hub reliability and diversification risk in Polish stock correlation networks. The available historical WIG20/mWIG40 sample contains 155 analysed stocks, 231 estimation origins and 73 complete retrospective forecast-test windows. Raw third-party prices are excluded."

